Gregor is a broad, heavily muscled human around forty, though he looks older: his hair is thin, and his skin is pitted with what look like old pox and frostbite scars. He wears simple leather armor with bands around his arms and carries a flail. He smokes, and it has left his voice rough. In a fight his skin breaks out in patches of rot and fungus.

Gregor is a high-ranking delving specialist of [[Org/The Scale/index|The Scale]], sent with three others to a Joker World at [[Geography/Star 221,325|Star 221,325]].
